{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b579ca9c-5a94-88b1-8232-0f33d8aca71b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T11:12:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:08:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Colin Brennan. I am calling about a noise problem. There is a bar near my mother's home, and the music from it is audible blocks away. I want to report it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:08:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Brennan. Is it your home, or your mother's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is my mother's. I am calling on her behalf. She is in her eighties and she does not like using the telephone. I am her son."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:09:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And how long has the music been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:09:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two weeks. Every night, the bass comes through the walls. Not the words of the songs, only the bass, but it is steady. I was there last Friday and I could hear it from the corner, which is two blocks from the bar. That is not a small thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two blocks, wow. Do you know the name of the bar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:09:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know the name, but I would like to be certain about the spelling before I say it. I will not give you the wrong one. [pause] It is on the sign as Harbor Lantern. H-A-R-B-O-R, Lantern, L-A-N-T-E-R-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Harbor Lantern, okay, I've got that. What time does the music usually start and stop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It starts around nine in the evening. It continues until after midnight. On Saturday my mother told me it was still going at one o'clock. I would like to know what the quiet hours are. Is there a time after which this is not permitted?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There are quiet hours in the city, and generally it's late at night, but I don't have the exact times in front of me and I don't want to give you the wrong ones. Let me check with the person who handles the noise ordinance. Can you hold a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:10:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I will hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. So I couldn't reach her directly. What I can do is log your complaint and have her call you back with the exact hours and what the process is. Is this the best number, ending in zero one six eight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:10:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The number is four zero one, five five five, zero one six eight. That is my own line. Please do not call my mother, because she will not answer and will become anxious. Call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:11:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, four zero one, five five five, zero one six eight, call Colin. Not your mom. Do you want me to note a time of day that's better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:11:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before two in the afternoon. After that I am at my mother's house, helping her sort things. She keeps reusable bags piled by the door, dozens of them, and I am trying to make her a system. So I may not hear the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, before two. And is there a street or an address I should put for the bar, or you don't have it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not want to give my mother's address in this call. I would prefer that the bar's name be sufficient for now, and I will provide the rest to the person who calls me. Is that acceptable?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:11:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Harbor Lantern is enough to start. She'll ask you for the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And when can I expect the call? I would like a specific answer. Today, tomorrow, next week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:12:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, I'd say within a couple of business days. I can't promise the hour, but I'll mark it so it doesn't sit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two business days. Then I will expect it by Friday. If I do not hear anything, I will call again and ask for you by name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:12:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Rosa, R-O-S-A. I'll put the note in right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:12:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Rosa. That is all I need today. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:12:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Brennan. Take care."
    }
  ],
